<title>ZAMBIA: ZAMBIAN MAY CONSUMER PRICE INDEX UP 23.5 PCT Y/Y.</title>
<headline>ZAMBIAN MAY CONSUMER PRICE INDEX UP 23.5 PCT Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's all-items consumer price</p>
<p>index fell by 1.1 percent in May, bringing the year-on-year</p>
<p>increase to 23.5 percent, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			 May 1996   April 1997   April 1996</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct change : 23.5	 26.7	   50.7</p>
<p>All items index  : 232.6	235.1	  188.4</p>
<p>Note: Index 1994 = 100</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom, +26 01-222689</p>
</text>
